[root] Plan remaining Caravan anchor walkthrough (planning)
Files: gameplay.vine; proposals/demo-gameplay.md; spec/**; proposals/**; crates/caravan-sample/**; evidence/**
Do: Turn the existing Caravan anchor's required queries and acceptance cases into an ordered demo walkthrough. Preserve the specified world behavior, keep game-facing meaning above host and transport plumbing, and keep implementation downstream of an explicit anchor-slice selection.
Accept: The inventory distinguishes implemented substrate from demonstrative gaps; one next anchor query slice is selected from the specification; its controls, composition, and evidence have disjoint owners; the demo remains an immutable-worldline toy; and no new gameplay semantics or generic engine extraction is introduced without a concrete requirement.
-> design-inventory
-> first-loop
-> interaction-surface
-> temporal-surface
-> demo-composition
-> demo-presentation
-> gameplay-evidence
-> boundary-polish
