[first-loop] Select the next anchor walkthrough slice (planning)
Files: proposals/demo-gameplay.md; gameplay.vine
Do: Use the anchor-derived inventory and required-query order to select one coherent next walkthrough slice. State the anchor query cases, available demo controls, visible result, authoritative journal/worldline consequence where applicable, and completion evidence. Keep the ruling at the demo/world layer without inventing new gameplay semantics.
Accept: One anchor slice is selected with one concrete acceptance trace; implementation starts from the specification's existing behavior rather than an unbounded feature list or an engine abstraction request.
-> design-inventory
