[interaction-surface] Define the selected interaction surface (notstarted)
Files: crates/caravan-sample/src/input.rs; crates/caravan-sample/src/transformation.rs; crates/caravan-sample/src/orchestrator.rs; proposals/input-and-interaction.md
Do: Define the closed input packets and transformations needed to navigate the selected anchor slice. Preserve SemanticInputBatch as the game-facing input value and JournalWriter as timestamp authority.
Accept: Every selected command has a closed transformation or explicit no-op/rejection path; transport identity remains below interaction logic; authoritative changes still require immutable journal or branch publication.
-> first-loop
