[temporal-surface] Define selected time, branch, and replay controls (notstarted)
Files: crates/caravan-sample/src/orchestrator.rs; crates/caravan-sample/src/stage.rs; proposals/caravan-orchestrator-anchor.md; spec/initial.md
Do: Define only the LogicalTime, Tau, branch, lookahead, persistence, or replay controls required to navigate the selected anchor slice. Keep host execution time non-authoritative and preserve arbitrary direct queries.
Accept: The selected controls have explicit ownership and deterministic behavior in past, present, future, branch, and replay cases where applicable; no mutable current-game-state shadow is introduced.
-> first-loop
