[demo-composition] Compose the selected loop through the game seams (notstarted)
Files: crates/caravan-sample/src/orchestrator.rs; crates/caravan-sample/src/stage.rs; crates/caravan-sample/src/publication.rs; crates/caravan-sample/src/host/**
Do: Wire the selected anchor walkthrough controls through Stage, Orchestrator, journal/branch publication, and the existing host ports. Reuse existing domain rules and query behavior without adding new world semantics.
Accept: One complete anchor observation cycle crosses the required input/control path, direct state query, and presentation without introducing a parallel authoritative state model.
